Master the beauty of minimalism and retain unique light and shadow——

Kuat ID Photo is an image processing software based on artificial intelligence technology that supports self-portraits for ID photos, one-click beautification, self-selected background color, automatic typesetting, and self-service printing.
Supports commonly used one-inch, two-inch, small one-inch and small two-inch specifications.

1. Intelligent cutout, automatic cropping, one-click background change, free export of high-definition negatives, and free skin replacement;
2. It supports both front and rear cameras, so you can complete the ID photo yourself without help;
3. Automatic typesetting based on 6-inch photo paper;
4. During shooting, it supports natural, smooth, whitening and rosy, supports commonly used filters, and can adjust the beauty effect by itself;

Various types of ID photos are often used in daily life, whether it is to find a job, apply for social security, or apply for a passport when traveling abroad. In the PC era, there was a computer with Photoshop installed, and professionals could use PS to process it. There were also light and shadow assistants and the like. Photo software can retouch, beautify, collage, and remove watermarks with one click. It can not only do white background photos and blue background photos, but also professional attire and artistic photos. With the popularization of mobile Internet smartphones, many beauty cameras have emerged, especially Meituxiuxiu, Beauty Camera, Yita Camera, Qingyan Camera, Awakening Picture, Ji Meng, Cutting, Qingyan camera, proknockout, inshotp, chiccam, 360 camera, vsco, nomo, faceu picture, b612 beauty camera, the cutout technology has become popular like a spark. In various video apps such as Xigua Video, Renren Video, Douyin, and Xiaohongshu, there are beauty, selfie, and puzzle masters everywhere. I even post pictures every day. In addition, there are often posts in forums such as Instant App and Hupu, asking for help from experts to remove the background.

